        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-21T22:11:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd say you played it right, as the \"cards in your hands\" section goes before the \"one on the bottom of the deck\". &nbsp;You played BWYN in the order it's written, so it makes sense on my end.</p><p>Your Draw phase, though, would obviously shuffle your trash back into your deck, so that solves the problem on subsequent rounds...</p>",
