        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-21T22:11:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Follow the instructions exactly as they're written for as long as you're able.&nbsp; If it says \"put two in your hand and one on the bottom\", and there's only two (or one) left, then you put two (or one) in your hand, and you're done.\"</p>",
